  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.5.1:\n- New: MotdReceived event — fires when the server's Message of the Day has been fully received (RPL_ENDOFMOTD 376)\n- New: MotdReceivedEvent class with IReadOnlyList<string> Lines property\n- MOTD lines accumulated between RPL_MOTDSTART (375) and RPL_ENDOFMOTD (376)\n- ERR_NOMOTD (422) handled gracefully (no event fired)\n- IIrcClient interface: 6 properties, 37 methods, 35 events\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/etushar89/IRCDotNet.Core#changelog",
